    <!--
      The Guide's figures for the sections about the case, security and exits, the work in the graph,
      labels, requests and obfuscation (docs/guide), written there as ![Bildtext](figur:<id>) and drawn
      from Figure.<id>. Each is drawn on a 560 x 200 surface inside a transparent frame, so that every
      figure has the same proportions. Colours only from Colors.xaml, and the graph's visual language:
      the accent is the victims' money, blue a withdrawal, red risk and the end of a trail, purple another
      chain, dashed always uncertain, round an actor we know nothing about and square a service.
      Generated by a script and kept simple: shapes and lines only, no text, which the caption gives.
    -->

